{#
   Club Spotlight (#spotlight) — every 12h, one of the 5 most active clubs
   (minimum ClubSpotlightService::MIN_SYNC_COUNT valid syncs in the window) is
   featured here. The redesign moves it directly under #pillars and adds a
   Facilities panel, a trophy/kit column and a closing CTA.

   Entirely client-rendered from data attributes: kit/badge via composeKitSvg(),
   owner and top-performer avatars via composePlayerSpriteSvg(), all four
   facility sites via the facility compositor's compose*Svg(). Every one of those
   scripts loads before landing.js — see base.html.twig.

   spotlight is the cached ClubSpotlight singleton, refreshed by
   app:spotlight:generate — never computed live here.

   Gated on spotlight.isLive(), i.e. windowEndsAt still in the future, not on
   clubName alone. The card says "FEATURED THIS CYCLE" and the note promises a
   12-hourly pick, so a row left behind by a stopped cron must drop out rather
   than keep advertising a cycle that ended days ago. A quiet cycle where the
   incumbent is still the most active club does NOT hide the section —
   selectNew() re-ups the window for exactly that case. _nav.html.twig gates its
   CLUB SPOTLIGHT jump link on the same flag, so it never scrolls nowhere.

   Career earnings shows dividendDrawsPence (real UserLedger DIVIDEND_DRAW
   entries against this club), not Club::$totalCareerEarnings — the latter is
   every income source the club ever had, not money the owner actually drew out.

   topPerformer* is a goals+assists-ranked proxy, not a literal "rating" —
   nothing persists a per-player match rating server-side. Its avatar renders
   only if that player has ever reported a sync v2 appearanceConfig; most have
   not, so the figure is omitted rather than drawn as a default body.

   NOT AVAILABLE from the payload, so not rendered: the design captions the
   stadium with a [STADIUM NAME]. ClubSpotlight carries no stadium name (it is
   NpcClub that has stadiumName; a player's own club does not snapshot one), so
   the caption is omitted rather than filled with the club's name, which would
   be a different fact.
#}
{% if spotlight.isLive %}

{#
   "N of 22 built", server-rendered so the count is text rather than something
   only a browser with JS can see.

   The three plot sites each carry an explicit on/off boolean per facility, so
   they are counted directly — `v is same as(true)` matches only those bare
   facility keys, since every *Construction is always false and every *Level is
   an int (see FacilityConfigBuilder).

   The stadium needs two passes. shop/museum/carpark have their own booleans.
   The four stands do not — and FacilityConfigBuilder::spriteLevel() is explicit
   that "not built" cannot be read off a level, because it floors at 1 so an
   unbuilt facility still draws a plot. That prohibition is about RENDERING: a
   renderer must not gate a building on its level. For counting it is safe here
   and only here, because spriteLevel is max(1, min(10, L*2)) — L=0 gives exactly
   1 and any L>=1 gives at least 2, so the floor never collides with a real
   level and `>= 2` is a lossless inverse of `club_facility.level > 0`. If that
   doubling ever changes, this count changes with it.
#}
{% set f = spotlight.facilities|default({}) %}
{% set st = f.stadium|default({}) %}
{% set builtBySite = {
    training: (f.training|default({}))|filter(v => v is same as(true))|length,
    medical:  (f.medical|default({}))|filter(v => v is same as(true))|length,
    scouting: (f.scouting|default({}))|filter(v => v is same as(true))|length,
    stadium:  ['shop', 'museum', 'carpark']|filter(k => st[k]|default(false))|length
              + ['north', 'east', 'south', 'west']|filter(k => st[k]|default(1) >= 2)|length
} %}
{% set builtTotal = builtBySite|reduce((carry, n) => carry + n, 0) %}

<section class="spotlight-section" id="spotlight" aria-labelledby="spotlight-title">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-label">Club Spotlight</div>

        <div class="spotlight-card"
             data-owner-appearance="{{ spotlight.ownerAppearance|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
             data-stadium-config="{{ spotlight.stadiumConfig|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
             data-performer-appearance="{{ spotlight.topPerformerAppearanceConfig|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
             data-home-kit="{{ spotlight.homeKitConfig|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
             data-away-kit="{{ spotlight.awayKitConfig|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
             data-club-badge="{{ {home: spotlight.homeKitConfig, away: spotlight.awayKitConfig, badge: spotlight.badgeConfig}|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}">

            <div class="spotlight-header">
                <h2 class="pixel spotlight-eyebrow" id="spotlight-title">FEATURED THIS CYCLE</h2>
                <div class="spotlight-badge-kit">
                    <span class="spotlight-badge-slot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <span class="spotlight-club-name vt">{{ spotlight.clubName }}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="spotlight-pitch">
                <figure class="spotlight-figure">
                    <span class="spotlight-owner-slot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    <figcaption class="spotlight-pitch-label vt">Owner</figcaption>
                </figure>
                <figure class="spotlight-figure spotlight-figure--stadium">
                    <span class="spotlight-stadium-slot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                </figure>
                {% if spotlight.topPerformerName is not empty %}
                    <figure class="spotlight-figure">
                        <span class="spotlight-performer-slot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        <figcaption class="spotlight-pitch-label vt">{{ spotlight.topPerformerName }}</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                {% endif %}
            </div>

            <dl class="spotlight-facts">
                <div class="spotlight-fact">
                    <dt class="vt">Owner</dt>
                    <dd class="pixel">{{ spotlight.ownerName ?? 'Anonymous' }}</dd>
                </div>
                {% if spotlight.establishedAt %}
                    <div class="spotlight-fact">
                        <dt class="vt">Established</dt>
                        <dd class="pixel">{{ spotlight.establishedAt|date('M Y') }}</dd>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}
                <div class="spotlight-fact">
                    <dt class="vt">Reputation</dt>
                    <dd class="pixel">{{ spotlight.clubReputation|number_format }}</dd>
                </div>
                <div class="spotlight-fact">
                    <dt class="vt">Dividends drawn</dt>
                    <dd class="pixel">£{{ (spotlight.dividendDrawsPence / 100)|round(0, 'floor')|number_format }}</dd>
                </div>
            </dl>

            {#
               Facilities panel — the featured club's REAL build-out, from
               ClubSpotlight.facilities (one json column, no extra query at render
               time; the whole point of the spotlight being a denormalised row).

               Null on rows generated before that column existed, in which case the
               panel is omitted entirely. Null must never read as "empty": every
               DEFAULT_*_CONFIG in the sprite bundle is the web builder's DEMO
               config, so a page that drew an empty payload would show a stranger's
               fully-built training ground as this club's.

               The sector blocks and tiles are built by landing.js from
               window.FACILITY_SITES (the bundle's own export of which facilities
               each site has) merged with the config below — the level badges and
               on/off state all come from this attribute. Hand-listing the 22
               facilities here would duplicate a mapping that is generated
               specifically so only one copy exists.
            #}
            {% if spotlight.facilities is not empty %}
                <div class="spotlight-facilities"
                     data-spotlight-facilities="{{ spotlight.facilities|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
                     data-built-by-site="{{ builtBySite|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}">
                    <div class="spotlight-facilities-head">
                        <h3 class="pixel spotlight-col-title">FACILITIES</h3>
                        <span class="spotlight-facilities-count">{{ builtTotal }} of 22 built · tile shows current level</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="spotlight-sectors"></div>
                </div>
            {% endif %}

            <div class="spotlight-columns">
                {% if spotlight.recentFixtures is not empty %}
                    <div class="spotlight-col">
                        <h3 class="pixel spotlight-col-title">RECENT FIXTURES</h3>
                        <ul class="spotlight-col-list">
                            {% for fixture in spotlight.recentFixtures %}
                                <li>
                                    <span class="spotlight-result-badge is-{{ fixture.result|lower }}">{{ fixture.result }}</span>
                                    <span class="spotlight-col-body">
                                        <span class="spotlight-col-main">vs {{ fixture.opponent }}</span>
                                        <span class="spotlight-col-sub">{{ fixture.scoreFor }}–{{ fixture.scoreAgainst }} · Wk {{ fixture.week }}</span>
                                    </span>
                                </li>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}

                {% if spotlight.recentTransfers is not empty %}
                    <div class="spotlight-col">
                        <h3 class="pixel spotlight-col-title">RECENT TRANSFERS</h3>
                        <ul class="spotlight-col-list">
                            {% for transfer in spotlight.recentTransfers %}
                                <li>
                                    <span class="spotlight-result-badge is-{{ transfer.direction == 'in' ? 'w' : 'l' }}">{{ transfer.direction == 'in' ? 'IN' : 'OUT' }}</span>
                                    <span class="spotlight-col-body">
                                        <span class="spotlight-col-main">{{ transfer.playerName }}</span>
                                        <span class="spotlight-col-sub">£{{ (transfer.feePence / 100)|round(0, 'floor')|number_format }} {{ transfer.direction == 'in' ? 'from' : 'to' }} {{ transfer.counterpartyClub }}</span>
                                    </span>
                                </li>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                {% endif %}

                <div class="spotlight-col">
                    {#
                       Honours board. Each trophy is drawn by composeTrophySvg() from
                       the chip's own data-trophy — the same renderer the admin leagues
                       screen and the trophy field widget use.

                       League::$trophy is nullable (an admin may simply not have set
                       one), so a tier can carry real titles and no trophy; those still
                       appear, as a count-only chip. Dropping them would under-report
                       real silverware. A row written before the trophy component was
                       replaced carries the retired trophyImage/trophyColour keys, which
                       parse to no `style` and are skipped rather than drawn wrong.
                    #}
                    {% if spotlight.trophies is not empty %}
                        <h3 class="pixel spotlight-col-title">TROPHY CABINET
                            <span class="spotlight-trophy-total">{{ spotlight.totalTrophies }}</span>
                        </h3>
                        <ul class="spotlight-trophy-list">
                            {% for trophy in spotlight.trophies %}
                                <li class="spotlight-trophy"
                                    title="{{ trophy.leagueName ?? 'Tier ' ~ trophy.tier }} — {{ trophy.titles }} {{ trophy.titles == 1 ? 'title' : 'titles' }}">
                                    {% if trophy.trophy ?? null %}
                                        <span class="spotlight-trophy-img"
                                              data-spotlight-trophy="{{ trophy.trophy|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}"
                                              aria-hidden="true"></span>
                                    {% endif %}
                                    <span class="spotlight-trophy-meta vt">
                                        <span class="spotlight-trophy-count">&times;{{ trophy.titles }}</span>
                                        <span class="spotlight-trophy-tier">{{ trophy.leagueName ?? 'Tier ' ~ trophy.tier }}</span>
                                    </span>
                                </li>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </ul>
                    {% endif %}

                    <h3 class="pixel spotlight-col-title">HOME &amp; AWAY KITS</h3>
                    <div class="spotlight-kits">
                        <figure class="spotlight-kit">
                            <span class="spotlight-kit-slot" data-spotlight-kit="home" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                            <figcaption class="vt">Home</figcaption>
                        </figure>
                        <figure class="spotlight-kit">
                            <span class="spotlight-kit-slot" data-spotlight-kit="away" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                            <figcaption class="vt">Away</figcaption>
                        </figure>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="spotlight-cta-bar">
                <span class="spotlight-note">Picked at random every 12 hours from the most active clubs. Keep syncing and build something worth featuring.</span>
                <a href="#get" class="btn btn-gold btn-lg">BUILD YOUR CLUB</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{% endif %}
